&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/5f92adbc2afb4a63829ed8314e0c4607/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;前言&lt;/a&gt;
